  "id": "visuospatial-sketchpad",
  "term": "visuospatial sketchpad",
  "definition": "The visuospatial sketchpad is a part of working memory that briefly holds and works with visual and spatial information. It supports tasks such as forming mental images, understanding where things are in relation to each other, and keeping or changing visual information during activities like navigation or visual search.",
